    "q-129562": {
      "dom_id": "step-q129562",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Evaluate the double integral ${∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A,$ where \n$D=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,-1\\le x\\le 1,\\,0\\le y\\le 2\\}.$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we express our double integral as a repeated integral:      \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}A & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{-1}^{1}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $x$, treating $y$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{-1}^{1}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}[{\\int }_{-1}^{1}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{[\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+x{y}^{2}]}_{-1}^{1}\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}[(\\frac{1}{3}+{y}^{2})-(-\\frac{1}{3}-{y}^{2})]\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}(\\frac{2}{3}+2{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}y\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we integrate with respect to $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}(\\frac{2}{3}+2{y}^{2})\\,\\text{d}y & ={[\\frac{2y}{3}+\\frac{2{y}^{3}}{3}]}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}(2+{2}^{3}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{20}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-129562-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "\\frac{8}{3}",
              "html": " <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"34\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
